  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5909.07 Lapse of EMS I and EMS I/C License",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5909.07 Lapse of EMS I and EMS I/C License. Any previously licensed EMS I or EMS I/C whose license has lapsed shall meet the following in order to have their license renewed:\n\n(a) If lapsed less than 2 years, the person shall meet the requirements set forth in Saf-C 5909.06; or\n\n(b) If lapsed more than 2 years, the person shall meet the requirements set forth in Saf-C 5909.04.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19; ss by #13953, eff 4-30-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5900.html"
